+### VR Painting Interface
+A VR painting interface using off-the-shelf controllers (HTC Vive) with specific gestures for transparency, radius, and color selection [S5, unofficial]. A novel 3D color picking interface allows one-handed color selection using an RGB-color cube [S5, unofficial]. The system records controller location and sub-samples at ~5Hz to paint [S5, unofficial]. Right-handed horizontal touch-swipe changes painting transparency and brush radius, which scales by zoom level [S5, unofficial]. Trigger pressure affects brush radius [S5, unofficial]. The user moves the controller inside the RGB-color cube to change brush color, and can rotate/translate the cube [S5, unofficial].
 
